  "consistency_review": [
    "The abstract reports nine articles and the Results section clarifies that one article contained two independent trials, yielding ten studies.",
    "The 15 mg-only response sensitivity analysis is non-significant while the 15 mg-only continuous HAM-D17 analysis remains significant; these are retained as distinct outcomes, not treated as a conflict.",
    "The Methods first describe fixed-effects models as sensitivity analyses but later contain the sentence “Random-effects models were performed as a sensitivity analysis.” The Results clearly present random-effects as the main models and fixed-effects as sensitivity analyses; extraction follows the detailed methods/results pattern and flags the wording inconsistency."
  ],
